Package: IowaDOTbasemaps
Type: Package
Title: Iowa DOT and CARTO Basemaps for Leaflet
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Guillermo", "Basulto-Elias", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "basulto@iastate.edu")
Description: Adds live Iowa Department of Transportation vector basemaps and
    authenticated CARTO basemaps to Leaflet maps and Shiny map proxies. Keeps
    basemap rendering below ordinary incident overlays, manages asynchronous
    layer removal, and provides catalog inspection and refresh utilities.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: leaflet (>= 2.2.0), htmltools (>= 0.5.0), jsonlite, curl
Suggests: shiny, testthat (>= 3.2.0), htmlwidgets
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: no
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/gbasulto/IowaDOTbasemaps
BugReports: https://github.com/gbasulto/IowaDOTbasemaps/issues
